     ],
     "text": "LX-40 user guide, firmware 2.3, page 1"
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "bbox": [
      40,
      80,
      560,
      120
     ],
     "text": "User guide, firmware 2.3. The LX-40 drives up to 40 DMX fixtures from one controller and stores up to 120 scenes."
    },
    {
     "kind": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "bbox": [
      40,
      40,
      560,
      70
     ],
     "text": "Corvel LX-40 Lighting Controller"
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "bbox": [
      40,
      160,
      290,
      240
     ],
     "text": "The rotary encoder selects menu items. Press and hold the encoder for 3 seconds to lock the front panel, and repeat to unlock it."
    },
    {
     "kind": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "bbox": [
      40,
      130,
      290,
      150
     ],
     "text": "1 Front panel"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "page": 2,
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "bbox": [
      40,
      360,
      560,
      430
     ],
     "text": "A scene stores a level for every channel. To record a scene, set the levels, press RECORD, then choose a scene number from 1 to 120. Fade times between scenes range from 0 to 60 seconds."
    },
    {
     "kind": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "bbox": [
      40,
      330,
      560,
      350
     ],
     "text": "4 Scenes"
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "bbox": [
      310,
      110,
      560,
      230
     ],
     "text": "The web interface user name is admin and there is no password until you set one. You must set a password of at least 10 characters before scenes can be edited over the network."
    },
    {
     "kind": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "bbox": [
      310,
      80,
      560,
      100
     ],
     "text": "3.1 Default credentials"
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "bbox": [
      40,
      190,
      290,
      300
     ],
     "text": "To switch to automatic addressing, open Settings, then Network, and set Address mode to DHCP. The controller restarts and shows its new address on the display."
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "bbox": [
      40,
      80,
      290,
      180
     ],
     "text": "From the factory the controller uses the static address 192.168.10.40 with subnet mask 255.255.255.0. Connect a laptop on the same subnet and open the address in a web browser."
    },
    {
     "kind": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "bbox": [
      40,
      40,
      560,
      60
     ],
     "text": "3 Network setup"
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "bbox": [
      40,
      15,
      560,
      30
     ],
     "text": "LX-40 user guide, firmware 2.3"
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "bbox": [
      40,
      770,
      560,
      785
     ],
     "text": "LX-40 user guide, firmware 2.3, page 2"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "bbox": [
      310,
      300,
      560,
      380
     ],
     "text": "To factory reset, hold the BACK and RECORD keys together while applying power, and keep them held for 10 seconds until the status LED flashes red."
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "bbox": [
      40,
      300,
      290,
      360
     ],
     "text": "Parameters are saved immediately. A factory reset restores every parameter in Table 2 to its default."
    },
    {
     "kind": "table",
     "bbox": [
      40,
      80,
      560,
      270
     ],
     "caption": "Table 2: Configuration parameters",
     "header": [
      "Parameter",
      "Default",
      "Range",
      "Notes"
     ],
     "rows": [
      [
       "DMX refresh rate",
       "40 Hz",
       "20 to 44 Hz",
       "Lower the rate for long cable runs"
      ],
      [
       "Startup scene",
       "1",
       "0 to 120",
       "0 means blackout at power on"
      ],
      [
       "Panel timeout",
       "120 seconds",
       "10 to 600 seconds",
       "The screen dims after this time"
      ],
      [
       "Trigger debounce",
       "50 ms",
       "10 to 500 ms",
       "Raise it if the trigger input chatters"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "kind": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "bbox": [
      40,
      40,
      560,
      60
     ],
     "text": "5 Configuration parameters"
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "bbox": [
      40,
